{"id":"9d381bf4-3933-404f-b3ca-7d5b283e74d4","title":"TIL - 1 Day","parentId":"10aeda9b-0fe1-8045-a8c4-f10918253453","category":"내일 배움 캠프 ( 백엔드 코스 7기)","categoryId":"source:내일 배움 캠프 ( 백엔드 코스 7기)","createdAt":"2024-09-23T02:57:14.867Z","updatedAt":"2024-10-18T04:54:26.095Z","markdown":"<a id=\"10aeda9b0fe1804b8f3dfbd3fa28e7c0\"></a>\n\n### 학습한 내용\n\n- SQL\n    <details>\n    <summary>SQL 개념</summary>\n\n    > <a href=\"#/post/108eda9b-0fe1-8075-8c0d-d40a042cccae\">페이지</a> &#45; 1주차, 2주차\n\n    <details>\n    <summary>1주차</summary>\n\n    - SQL 기본 명령문\n        - 테이블 지정&#58; from\n\n        - 컬럼 지정&#58; select\n\n        - 별명(alias)\n            - 컬럼 as “이름”\n\n            - 컬럼 “이름”\n\n        <details>\n        <summary>필터링&#58; where</summary>\n\n        - 비교연산자&#58; &#60;, &#62;, =, &#60;&#62; …\n\n        - <code>BETWEEN</code>&#58; 사이 값, <code>IN</code>&#58; 값 포함, <code>LIKE</code>&#58; 특정 문자 포함\n\n        - 논리연산 → 조건 여러개\n\n        </details>\n\n    </details>\n\n    <details>\n    <summary>2주차</summary>\n\n    - 컬럼 계산\n        - 산술연산자&#58; <code>&#43;</code>, <code>&#45;</code>, <code>/</code>, <code>&#42;</code>\n\n        - 합계(<code>SUM</code>), 평균(<code>AVG</code>)\n\n        - 데이터 갯수(<code>COUNT</code>)\n\n        - 최솟값(<code>MIN</code>), 최댓값(<code>MAX</code>)\n\n    - 컬럼 별 연산 (컬럼 for문)&#58; <code>GROUP BY</code>\n\n    - 정렬(내림차순, 오름차순)&#58; <code>ORDER BY &#91;DESC, ASC(기본값)&#93;</code>\n\n    - 기본 SQL 문 구조\n        <a id=\"10aeda9b0fe180cea012f3ab50116346\"></a>\n\n        ```sql\n        select\n        from\n        where\n        group by\n        order by\n        ```\n\n    </details>\n\n    </details>\n\n    <details>\n    <summary><strong>SQL 문제</strong></summary>\n\n    <a id=\"10aeda9b0fe18051a3c2cce86546d5b6\"></a>\n\n    <a href=\"#/post/108eda9b-0fe1-8022-a801-efceee08ffaf\">페이지</a> \n\n    <a id=\"f6566c6801eb4770a45753cfd4b2b9f4\"></a>\n\n    <a href=\"#/post/108eda9b-0fe1-8075-9aa7-f14a94776851\">페이지</a> \n\n    <a id=\"10aeda9b0fe1804a8e70d